{"id": "34e4a4aa-4544-4a1a-8845-2a131ea85838", "slug": "aurora-digital-innovation-studio", "title": "Aurora - Digital Innovation Studio", "description": "Aurora Digital Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Aurora - Digital Innovation Studio\"\ndescription: \"Aurora Digital Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#D4FF00\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#D4FF00\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#F0EBE1\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#888888\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Playfair Display\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Aurora - Digital Innovation Studio\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 142; favorites: 10; remixes: 1.\nTags: feature, section, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nAurora Digital Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nAurora™ Work About Approach Journal Let's Build Digital Innovation Studio IDEAS THAT SHAPE T O M RROW We design and build digital experiences that inspire, engage, and drive real impact. Explore our work Where Vision Me…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: IDEAS THAT SHAPE T O M RROW.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #D4FF00, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #D4FF00, background #FFFFFF, surface #F0EBE1, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Playfair Display for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aurora - Digital Innovation Studio</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    colors: {\n                        background: '#0a0a0a',\n                        surface: '#111111',\n                        primary: '#f0ebe1',\n                        accent: '#d4ff00',\n                        muted: '#888888'\n                    },\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                        serif: ['Playfair Display', 'serif'],\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-background text-primary overflow-hidden antialiased font-sans relative h-screen w-screen flex flex-col selection:bg-accent selection:text-black\">\n\n    <!-- Ambient WebGL/Canvas Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"ambient-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-30 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full px-6 md:px-12 py-8 flex justify-between items-center z-50 mix-blend-difference gs-nav\">\n        <!-- Logo -->\n        <div class=\"text-sm tracking-widest font-medium uppercase text-primary\">Aurora&trade;</div>\n\n        <!-- Links -->\n        <div class=\"hidden lg:flex gap-12 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-primary/60 font-light\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-300\">Work</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-300\">About</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-300\">Approach</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-300\">Journal</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Actions -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n            <button class=\"hidden md:block text-xs uppercase tracking-widest px-8 py-3 rounded-full border border-primary/20 hover:bg-primary hover:text-black transition-all duration-500 ease-out\">Let's Build</button>\n            <button class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-primary hover:text-black transition-all duration-500 ease-out group\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" class=\"text-xl group-hover:scale-90 transition-transform duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Container -->\n    <main class=\"flex-1 relative w-full h-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row\">\n\n        <!-- Left Column (Text Content) -->\n        <div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 h-full flex flex-col justify-center px-6 md:px-12 lg:pl-24 lg:pr-12 z-20 relative pt-24 lg:pt-0 pb-24 lg:pb-0\">\n\n            <!-- Eyebrow -->\n            <div class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary/50 mb-8 gs-reveal font-light\">\n                Digital Innovation Studio\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Headline -->\n            <h1 class=\"font-serif text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl leading-none tracking-tighter mb-10 gs-reveal flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"block gs-text origin-bottom-left\">IDEAS</span></div>\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"block gs-text origin-bottom-left\">THAT SHAPE</span></div>\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gs-text origin-bottom-left\">\n                        T<span class=\"tracking-normal\">O</span>M<span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center mx-1 md:mx-2 text-primary/90\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-linear\" class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl\"></iconify-icon></span>RROW\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Paragraph -->\n            <p class=\"text-primary/60 text-sm md:text-base max-w-md leading-relaxed mb-12 gs-reveal font-light\">\n                We design and build digital experiences that inspire, engage, and drive real impact.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- CTA -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 gs-reveal group cursor-pointer w-max\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-primary/80 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-300 font-medium\">Explore our work</span>\n                <div class=\"w-16 h-[1px] bg-primary/20 group-hover:bg-primary/60 transition-colors duration-300 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-primary -translate-x-full group-hover:translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:border-primary/60 transition-colors duration-300\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-xl group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Column (Image & Visuals) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute lg:relative right-0 top-0 w-full lg:w-1/2 h-full z-10 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none lg:pointer-events-auto opacity-30 lg:opacity-100\">\n\n            <!-- Intersecting Thin Circle Graphic -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 -left-[30%] lg:-left-[20%] w-[90vh] h-[90vh] rounded-full border border-accent/20 z-20 pointer-events-none circle-spin\">\n                <!-- Glowing Dot on circle -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 -left-1.5 w-3 h-3 bg-primary rounded-full shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(240,235,225,0.8)]\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Main Imagery -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full bg-surface overflow-hidden\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618666012174-83b441c0bc76?auto=format&fit=crop&q=100&w=2000\" alt=\"Classical Bust Profile\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center mix-blend-luminosity opacity-90 scale-110 gs-image origin-center\" style=\"filter: contrast(1.25) brightness(0.85);\" />\n\n                <!-- Blending Gradients -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-background via-background/50 to-transparent w-full lg:w-1/2\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-background via-transparent to-transparent h-1/2 top-auto bottom-0\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-background via-transparent to-transparent h-1/4\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Floating Right Card (Premium Surface) -->\n        <div class=\"hidden lg:flex absolute bottom-24 right-12 w-[300px] bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-2xl rounded-[2rem] p-10 z-40 gs-card flex-col justify-between shadow-2xl overflow-hidden group\">\n\n            <!-- Subtle Border Gradient via Masking -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-[2rem] border border-transparent bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/30 via-transparent to-primary/5 opacity-50 pointer-events-none\" style=\"mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) padding-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0); -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) padding-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0); -webkit-mask-composite: destination-out; mask-composite: exclude;\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-16 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:stars-linear\" class=\"text-primary text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] leading-loose uppercase text-primary/90 mb-16 font-light\">\n                Where<br>Vision<br>Meets<br>Execution\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-primary/50 font-medium\">\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-accent rounded-full relative\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-accent rounded-full animate-ping opacity-50\"></div>\n                </div>\n                Scroll to discover\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Status Bar -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full px-6 md:px-12 py-6 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-primary/10 z-30 bg-background/80 backdrop-blur-md gs-bottom\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 md:gap-8 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-primary/50 font-light w-full\">\n\n                <!-- Rotating icon element -->\n                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center relative spin-slow mr-2\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-accent rounded-full absolute top-2 right-2\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-primary/30 rounded-full absolute bottom-2 left-2\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 md:gap-8 flex-1\">\n                    <span class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap\">Bespoke Solutions</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-accent text-[0.5rem]\">•</span>\n                    <span class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap hidden sm:inline-block\">Global Perspective</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-accent text-[0.5rem] hidden sm:inline-block\">•</span>\n                    <span class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap hidden md:inline-block\">Measurable Impact</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Interactions & Animations -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin();\n\n            // Setup initial states\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: \"power4.out\" } });\n\n            gsap.set(\".gs-nav\", { y: -30, opacity: 0 });\n            gsap.set(\".gs-text\", { y: \"110%\", rotationZ: 2 });\n            gsap.set(\".gs-reveal\", { y: 30, opacity: 0 });\n            gsap.set(\".gs-image\", { scale: 1.15, opacity: 0 });\n            gsap.set(\".gs-card\", { y: 40, opacity: 0, scale: 0.95 });\n            gsap.set(\".gs-bottom\", { y: \"100%\" });\n\n            // Master Animation Sequence\n            tl.to(\".gs-image\", {\n                duration: 3,\n                scale: 1,\n                opacity: 0.9,\n                ease: \"power3.inOut\"\n            }, 0)\n            .to(\".gs-nav\", {\n                duration: 1.2,\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1\n            }, 0.5)\n            .to(\".gs-text\", {\n                duration: 1.5,\n                y: \"0%\",\n                rotationZ: 0,\n                stagger: 0.15\n            }, 0.8)\n            .to(\".gs-reveal\", {\n                duration: 1.2,\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                stagger: 0.1\n            }, 1.2)\n            .to(\".gs-bottom\", {\n                duration: 1.2,\n                y: \"0%\"\n            }, 1.4)\n            .to(\".gs-card\", {\n                duration: 1.5,\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                scale: 1,\n                ease: \"back.out(1.2)\"\n            }, 1.6);\n\n            // Continuous Animations\n            gsap.to(\".circle-spin\", {\n                rotation: 360,\n                duration: 60,\n                repeat: -1,\n                ease: \"none\"\n            });\n\n            gsap.to(\".spin-slow\", {\n                rotation: -360,\n                duration: 20,\n                repeat: -1,\n                ease: \"none\"\n            });\n\n            // Ambient WebGL/Canvas Particle System\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('ambient-canvas');\n            const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n            let width, height;\n            let particles = [];\n\n            function resize() {\n                width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n                height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n            }\n\n            class Particle {\n                constructor() {\n                    this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                    this.y = Math.random() * height;\n                    this.size = Math.random() * 1.2 + 0.2;\n                    this.speedX = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.3;\n                    this.speedY = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.3;\n                    this.baseOpacity = Math.random() * 0.4 + 0.1;\n                    this.pulseSpeed = Math.random() * 0.02 + 0.01;\n                    this.angle = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n                }\n                update() {\n                    this.x += this.speedX;\n                    this.y += this.speedY;\n\n                    // Wrap around\n                    if (this.x < 0) this.x = width;\n                    if (this.x > width) this.x = 0;\n                    if (this.y < 0) this.y = height;\n                    if (this.y > height) this.y = 0;\n\n                    this.angle += this.pulseSpeed;\n                    this.currentOpacity = this.baseOpacity + Math.sin(this.angle) * 0.15;\n                }\n                draw() {\n                    ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(240, 235, 225, ${Math.max(0, this.currentOpacity)})`;\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, this.size, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                    ctx.fill();\n                }\n            }\n\n            function initParticles() {\n                particles = [];\n                const particleCount = window.innerWidth > 768 ? 150 : 70;\n                for (let i = 0; i < particleCount; i++) {\n                    particles.push(new Particle());\n                }\n            }\n\n            function animateCanvas() {\n                ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n                particles.forEach(p => {\n                    p.update();\n                    p.draw();\n                });\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateCanvas);\n            }\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                resize();\n                initParticles();\n            });\n\n            resize();\n            initParticles();\n            animateCanvas();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aurora-digital-innovation-studio.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/aurora-digital-innovation-studio.jpg", "source_name": "aurora-digital-innovation-studio-DESIGN.md", "views": 206, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "1a62ed4c-6d0d-4900-8de2-1f3139579949", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T11:30:12.892885+00:00"}